<title>FINLAND: Valmet 8-mth profit up to FIM 664 mln.</title>
<headline>Valmet 8-mth profit up to FIM 664 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months to August 31,</p>
<p>				    (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after financial items	    664 vs 328</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)	    5.79 vs 3.51</p>
<p> Net sales				   7,364 vs 5,008</p>
<p> Operating profit			    617 vs 257</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' median forecast profit after financial items was 647 million markka (mean 661 million) in a 600 million to 764 million markka range.  </p>
<p> Gross profit				1,736 vs 1,209</p>
<p> Selling and marketing expenses	  422 vs 350</p>
<p> R&amp;D expenses				  240 vs 178</p>
<p> Administrative expenses		   457 vs 424</p>
<p> Net financial items		   gain 50 vs 24 gain</p>
<p>Share of results of</p>
<p> associated companies		 charge 3 vs 47 gain</p>
<p> Extraordinary items		 charge 45 vs 58 gain</p>
<p> Profit before minorities, taxes	 619 vs 386</p>
<p> Taxes					   174 vs 24</p>
<p> Minorities			    charge 11 vs 5 charge</p>
<p> Net profit				    434 vs 357</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)     40.1 vs 38.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish paper machine maker is Valmet Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0245</p>
</text>
